# Whitelist: ignore everything, then un-ignore authored paths only.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!Makefile
!ld_script.txt
!docs/**
!config/**
!tools/**
!scripts/**
!ops/**
!asm/**
!src/**
!include/**
!spikes/**

# LAST WORD: game data, build outputs and private state are never tracked, wherever they are.
*.gba
*.GBA
*.sav
*.SAV
*.sa1
*.srm
*.elf
*.o
*.bin
*.BIN
*.4bpp
*.8bpp
*.gbapal
*.lz
*.png
*.bmp
*.raw
*.zip
*.csv.bak
private/
rom/
